            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Cua Oc",
            "review_text": "Richard C\nMarlborough, United Kingdom29 contributions\n0\nDelicious crab soup\nSep 2019 • Couples\nAnother unassuming hole in the wall. Blink and you'd miss it. But don't miss it because it's excellent.\n\nWe arrived by scooter and were parked up by Mr Boss who has a seat outside and keeps a close eye on proceedings.\n\nIt didn't take long to decide what to order as there's only 3 things on the menu. Crab soup with crispy fish, Crab soup with snails or crab soup with crispy fish and snails. You can have extra fish or snails if you like. Either way it's a reassuringly simple menu. They cook the same thing each night and all that practice has really paid off, it is simply delicious. \n\nIt's not delicious in a Michelin star way so don't go with haute cuisine expectations, it's delicious in a \"full of locals and a steady takeaway service\" way. Delicious in a \" less than $7 us dollars including 2 drinks\" way.\n\nAt time of writing this is way down the trip Advisor list of restaurants in Saigon. I went with my Vietnamese girlfriend on her recommendation and was the only westerner there, I don't think too many tourists have found this place yet. Its a bit of a hidden gem. Go now before there's a queue out the door.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 26, 2019",
