            "review_text": "Anthony P\n22 contributions\n0\nDelicious soup\nJul 2017 • Solo\nI had a delicious lunch and it is very reasonable for bun rieu oc only 45,000 VND. The oc is served on the side and is marinated in a sauce that is slightly sweet and slightly spicy. They were quite busy at lunch time around 130pm with many business people in the area coming here and many take out orders even.\n\nNote: my American belly did experience some GI distress many hours later but it is unclear if it was from this meal or other snacks. Fresh produce is always a gamble. I would risk it again however because it was so delicious.\nRead more\nWritten July 5, 2017",
